/AP 1104 0 R
/BS 1105 0 R
/Contents <>
/CreationDate (D:20130228131310-05'00')
/DA (0 G 0 g 0 Tc 0 Tw 100 Tz 12.8 TL 0 Ts 0 Tr /Cour 9 Tf)
/DS (font: Sylfaen 9.0pt;font-stretch:Normal; text-align:left; color:#000000 )
/F 4
/IT /FreeTextTypewriter
/M (D:20130304084117-05'00')
/NM (ffb67404-07ff-48ca-a694-aead72758952)
/P 11 0 R
/RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:10.1.5" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:9.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-family:Sylfaen;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="line-height:12.8pt">The research discussed in this report was performed under ACRP Project  03-17,  &#8220;Evaluating Airfield &#13;</span></p><p dir="ltr"><span style="line-height:12.8pt">Capacity,&#8221;  by a research  team of  recognized experts  in airport planning,  air traffic control  and  air-&#13;</span></p><p dir="ltr"><span style="line-height:12.8pt">field operations,  and  airfield and airspace capacity.  LeighFisher was the primary research consultant.  &#13;</span></p><p dir="ltr"><span style="line-height:12.8pt">William  J.  Dunlay,  PhD,  Director  at LeighFisher,  was  the Principal  Investigator;  and  Suzanne E. &#13;</span></p><p dir="ltr"><span style="line-height:12.8pt">Akkoush,  Senior  Consultant  at  LeighFisher,  was the Project  Manager.  Landrum &amp; Brown  was the&#13;</span></p><p dir="ltr"><span style="line-height:12.8pt">Principal  Subconsultant  for  the  research.  Matthew  H.  Lee,  Vice President  at  Landrum &amp; Brown,  &#13;</span></p><p dir="ltr"><span style="line-height:12.8pt">was the  Deputy Principal Investigator;  and Pamela S. Keidel-Adams,  Managing Director at Landrum &#13;</span></p><p dir="ltr"><span style="line-height:12.8pt">&amp; Brown  \(formerly  Senior Vice  President  at  CDM  Smith\),  was  the  Deputy Project Manager. The &#13;</span></p><p dir="ltr"><span style="line-height:12.8pt">other authors were Amit Lagu, Senior Consultant at LeighFisher; Brian R. Poe, Consultant at Landrum  &#13;</span></p><p dir="ltr"><span style="line-height:12.8pt">&amp; Brown; Mark Hansen, Professor at the University  of  California, Berkeley;  Lance Sherry, Associate  &#13;</span></p><p dir="ltr"><span style="line-height:12.8pt">Professor \(Research\)  at the George Mason University; Amy Kim, Assistant Professor at the University &#13;</span></p><p dir="ltr"><span style="line-height:12.8pt">of Alberta; and Yi Liu, PhD student at the University of California, Berkeley.  Patti Douglas, President &#13;</span></p><p dir="ltr"><span style="line-height:12.8pt">at Presentation  &amp;  Design  Inc.,  provided  graphical support throughout the research process.  The re-&#13;</span></p><p dir="ltr"><span style="line-height:12.8pt">search team would like to  thank the many aviation researchers and airport staff  who took the time to &#13;</span></p><p dir="ltr"><span style="line-height:12.8pt">share their insights,  experience, and opinions with the team;  in particular, the staff at  MITRE Corpo-&#13;</span></p><p dir="ltr"><span style="line-height:12.8pt">ration  \(Peter  Kuzminski  and  Jennifer  Gentry\)  for  their  cooperation  and  for  providing  a  testing  &#13;</span></p><p dir="ltr"><span style="line-height:12.8pt">license, training, and sample files for the  runwaySimulator, and Jim Henriksen of Wolverine Software  &#13;</span></p><p dir="ltr"><span style="line-height:12.8pt">for providing a runtime license for SLX and Proof.&#13;</span></p></body>)
/Rect [168.656 51.4432 562.511 286.282]
